# The files in inst/extdata are verbatim Winsteps output, captured from a real
# run on Windows. Git must not translate their line endings in either
# direction: the bytes are the point of a fixture, and a checkout that rewrote
# them would make the round-trip test compare the package against something
# Winsteps did not write.
#
# This also prevents the merge that produced this file: with translation on,
# a CRLF copy and an LF copy of the same output conflict on every single line.
inst/extdata/** -text
